+# v35 — saved obtained gems and Endless mode
+
+- Persist the daily count with each obtained choice. Recover older saved
+  Sniper sightings if their daily ledger was missing; never reset on app exit,
+  route reset or opening a different extracted app folder in the same account.
+- Commit each find and its location/score metadata before notifying the UI or
+  clicking the gem, including finds within the screenshot cooldown. Capture
+  completion and UI replays preserve the original time and obtained choice.
+- Click the /5 counter, or History → Daily gems, for the daily list. Obtained
+  defaults to checked. Untick missed gems to subtract them and retick to add
+  them back. Keep their original history and screenshots, including entries
+  whose old screenshot is unavailable. Today only uses the 16:00 Sofia day.
+- Add Endless mode directly below Gems found. Its preference survives restart.
+  When enabled, scan beyond 5/5 with the existing collection/return sequence.
+  Turning it off restores the normal five-obtained goal. Stop/F10 always stops.
+- An obtained choice changed during collection is rechecked before stopping.
+- Keep v34 smooth movement and dim-outline confirmation, the exact four map
+  control boxes, no padding/portal blacklist, cursor confinement, saved routes,
+  Gem Spy observation-only histories, and the 1 hour 15 second sighting dots.
+
+Validation: obtained storage/migration/replay/forced-exit checks, normal/endless
+runner cases and cancellation, two native Windows app launches on one profile,
+real detector/photo pipeline with simulated game input, source/frozen GUI and
+native input checks, full route comparison and complete archive hash checks.
+No private recordings or user databases are packaged. No live BlueStacks run
+is claimed; Obtained defaults true and remains the user's collection judgment.
